# Ignore everything by default; only Jupyter notebooks, stylesheets, and PDF
# sample documents are tracked in this repo.
*

# Allow traversal into subdirectories so the rules below can match nested files
!*/

# Keep this file itself
!.gitignore

# Keep notebooks, CSS, and sample document PDFs (at any nesting level)
!*.ipynb
!*.css
!*.pdf
Policy_RAG_Chatbot_Project_Plan.pdf
# Keep README and its screenshot(s)
!README.md
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg

# Advance RAG Pipeline: track its source code, config, tests, docs and diagrams
# (secrets stay out: .env is ignored by that folder's own .gitignore; only .env.example is kept)
!Advance RAG Pipeline/**/*.py
!Advance RAG Pipeline/**/*.yaml
!Advance RAG Pipeline/**/*.html
!Advance RAG Pipeline/**/*.svg
!Advance RAG Pipeline/**/*.jsonl
!Advance RAG Pipeline/**/*.md
!Advance RAG Pipeline/requirements.txt
!Advance RAG Pipeline/.env.example
